              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Okwo nikwo Saulo yaafiire ahabw'ekicumuro kye, eki yaacumwire ahari MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba taroorobeire kigambo kya MUKAMA, kandi akeehanuuza aha muntu orikugambisa emizimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
